  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=835030), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11997335)  \n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[T.Chinese](https://www.webtoons.com/zh-hant/slice-of-life/honey-are-you-asleep/list?title_no=8037), [Thai](https://www.webtoons.com/th/romance/sleeping/list?title_no=8158), [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003892) \n\nIt begins with Ji Woo-sun and Kwon Joo-tae, a sexless couple, trying to have a hot night. She makes every effort, such as playing a drinking game or buying perfume advertised on the Internet, but is blocked by Joo-tae's iron wall of defense and fails to get a bed every time.",
